icWlWSnNoZE53eGd1YzFwaEdZQnhmc0xOTWZ2SGpuTm1PaWdJTzlDYW5ULWNRMDI5S3M0Tm53TG4wYjdHSXVlX0RCMVZwaklhdXg2VkR2V3F2dGNuZzlpWm9Vck5sQnZhbGY5bzQ4cU5nM0tzMDc2MjNoX2tzMWpzZ1BCcXJkcS02VlRUWERZVEhCclVtOFdCZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"先是 F5，現在是 Fortinet：華爾街停止支付超出收益的證券股票"},{"title":"Fortinet (FTNT) Reports Strong Q3 Growth, Raises 2026 Guidance A","src":"GuruFocus","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOM3lHWEFvWDN5QmluQ1dSeHRWQV9OOVYxZGRUUlNMNEgtTXVBdXJYMEFZRG1WZUZlYUhMenBKSktQM1ZicXBTOE10X2VLaGs5VU5NRDFjbEw2VjNDcTRua1R2WDhYSERwUS14ZEtzUm5OODdZUFlLWjZpWnVIMjF5MU9JRkFsb1ZVb2dFelZhQXAzTTRDZ3hDSjhxcTVBakRWTmlEbUtkR3lzSF9RQ2oycElMMWVZQjZlQXU1LXZ0c3RrcjZwQVA2SVlncw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Fortinet (FTNT) 報告第三季強勁成長，提高 2026 年指引 A"},{"title":"Unusual Options Activity: Fortinet Down 25.3%. The Most Active Put Contract Surges 386%, With 88 Contracts Traded.","src":"Moomoo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNUE9Cc0llY1MweG1meENEcWNZUGU3RkJKcnV3QkJDVl8wUVBTV3BHNEV6OVZoSjh0NnppNWFoeEc1eWs0Q1Q4NGpEYlVyc0IwXzFJS0lING9kMGRGYUI2M3MwWTVGQXFZcXc1R0tJQ3ZLYkRnMl83V1FsQ3l5dkt1UFc4Nk9xNG1sM2NTaU13Z29XNHhscU9vZVVUQU1RcUt0Nm5OMjFB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"異常選擇權活動：Fortinet 下跌 25.3%。最活躍的看跌合約飆漲386%，成交88張合約。"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1262039/000126203926000007/ftnt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Fortinet is a leader in cybersecurity, driving the convergence of networking and security. Our mission is to secure people, devices and data everywhere. Our integrated platform, the Fortinet Security Fabric, spans secure networking, unified Secure Access Service Edge (\"SASE\") and artificial intelligence (\"AI\")-driven security operations (\"SecOps\"). As of December 31, 2025, our end-customers were located in over 100 countries and included enterprises across a wide variety of market verticals, including financial services, retail, healthcare and operational technology (\"OT\") market verticals, communication and security service providers, and government organizations. As a global company headquartered in Sunnyvale, California, our research and development is centered in the United States and Canada with a global footprint of support and centers of excellence around the world. As of December","zh":"Fortinet 是網路安全領域的領導者，致力於推動網路與安全的整合。我們的使命是保護各地人員、設備和資料的安全。我們的整合平台 Fortinet Security Fabric 涵蓋安全網路、統一安全存取服務邊緣（「SASE」）和人工智慧（「AI」）驅動的安全操作（「SecOps」）。截至2025年12月31日，我們的最終客戶遍布100多個國家，包括各個垂直市場的企業，包括金融服務、零售、醫療保健和營運技術（「OT」）垂直市場、通訊和安全服務提供者以及政府組織。作為一家總部位於加州桑尼維爾的跨國公司，我們的研發中心位於美國和加拿大，支援足跡遍布全球，並在世界各地設有卓越中心。截至 12 月"},{"en":"Our competitive differentiation lies in our core technologies, which together provide performance, security, flexibility and integration across diverse environments.","zh":"我們的競爭優勢在於我們的核心技術，這些技術共同提供跨不同環境的效能、安全性、靈活性和整合。"},{"en":"FortiOS—Our unified operating system enables the convergence of networking and AI-powered security to enforce consistent policies across all form factors and edges. As the foundational engine of the Fortinet Security Fabric, FortiOS empowers organizations to unify management and analytics, providing network visibility and control at scale. FortiOS includes advanced encryption and other security technologies designed to address evolving cybersecurity threats, including emerging quantum-resistant cryptographic capabilities.","zh":"FortiOS－我們的統一作業系統能夠融合網路和人工智慧驅動的安全性，從而在所有外形尺寸和邊緣上實施一致的策略。作為 Fortinet Security Fabric 的基礎引擎，FortiOS 使組織能夠統一管理和分析，提供大規模的網路可見度和控制。 FortiOS 包括先進的加密和其他安全技術，旨在解決不斷變化的網路安全威脅，包括新興的抗量子加密功能。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our end-customers are located in over 100 countries and include small, medium and large enterprises and government organizations across a wide range of industries, including financial services, government, manufacturing, retail, technology, education, healthcare and telecommunications. An end-customer deployment may involve as few as one or as many as dozens of different types of integrated products and services from across our broad portfolio that spans secure networking, unified SASE, and security operations. Depending on the solution or form factor purchased, customers may also access our products via the cloud through our data centers and PoPs, third-party colocations and cloud providers such as Amazon Web Services,","zh":"我們的最終客戶遍佈 100 多個國家，包括金融服務、政府、製造、零售、科技、教育、醫療保健和電信等各行各業的小型、中型和大型企業和政府組織。最終客戶部署可能涉及我們涵蓋安全網路、統一 SASE 和安全營運的廣泛產品組合中的少至一種或多至數十種不同類型的整合產品和服務。根據購買的解決方案或外形尺寸，客戶還可以透過我們的資料中心和 PoP、第三方主機託管和雲端供應商（例如 Amazon Web Services）透過雲端存取我們的產品，"},{"en":"Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud. Often, our customers also purchase our FortiGuard and other security subscription services and FortiCare technical support services. Refer to Note 15. Segment Information in Part II, Item 8 of this Annual Report on Form 10-K for distributor customers accounted for 10% or more of our revenue or net accounts receivable.","zh":"微軟 Azure 和谷歌雲端。通常，我們的客戶也會購買我們的 FortiGuard 和其他安全訂閱服務以及 FortiCare 技術支援服務。請參閱附註15。本年報10-K表格第二部分第8項中針對經銷商客戶的分部資料占我們收入或應收帳款淨額的10%或以上。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for our products are extremely competitive and are characterized by rapid technological change. The principal competitive factors in our markets include:","zh":"我們產品的市場競爭極為激烈，而且科技日新月異。我們市場的主要競爭因素包括："},{"en":"Among others, our competitors include Check Point Software Technologies Ltd. (\"Check Point\"), Cisco Systems, Inc. (\"Cisco\"), CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc. (\"CrowdStrike\"), F5 Networks, Inc. (\"F5 Networks\"), Hewlett-Packard Enterprise (\"HPE\"), Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. (\"Huawei\"), Microsoft Corporation (\"Microsoft\"), Netskope Inc. (\"Netskope\"), Palo Alto Networks, Inc. (\"Palo Alto Networks\"), SonicWALL, Inc. (\"SonicWALL\"), Sophos Group Plc (\"Sophos\") and Zscaler, Inc. (\"Zscaler\").","zh":"其中，我們的競爭對手包括 Check Point Software Technologies Ltd.（「Check Point」）、Cisco Systems, Inc.（「Cisco」）、CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc.（「CrowdStrike」）、F5 Networks, Inc.（「F5 Networks」）、Hewlett-Packard Enterprise（「HPE」）、「中國科技」有限公司（華為「 Alto Networks, Inc.（「Palo Alto Networks」）、SonicWALL, Inc.（「SonicWALL」）、Sophos Group Plc（「Sophos」）和 Zscaler, Inc.（「Zscaler」）。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":4581200000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Security Subscription","val":2633200000,"zh":"安全訂閱"},{"name":"Technical Support & Other","val":1948000000,"zh":"技術支援及其他"}],"total":6799600000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Europe Middle East & Africa","val":2834300000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲"},{"name":"Americas","val":2700400000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":1929500000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Asia Pacific & Japan","val":1264900000,"zh":"亞太地區和日本"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":770900000,"zh":"其他美洲"}],"total":6799600000}},"peers":["PANW","ZS","CRWD","OKTA","ANET"]}}